---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const updated = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', { dateStyle: 'long' }).format(new Date('2026-11-11'));
---

<TextPage
  title="Privacy Policy | HearMyMic"
  description="How HearMyMic handles your data. Your audio and video are processed in your browser and never uploaded. Details on cookies and analytics."
  path="/privacy"
  h1="Privacy policy"
  crumb="Privacy"
>
  <p class="text-muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your audio and video never leave your device. Nothing you say or show is uploaded, stored or shared.</li>
    <li>There are no accounts and we don’t ask for your name or email address.</li>
    <li>The site may use basic analytics from Google. Details are below.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Microphone and camera</h2>
  <p>
    The tests on this site run entirely in your browser. When you allow access, the audio from your microphone and the
    picture from your camera are processed by code running on your own device to draw the level meter, waveform and
    preview.
  </p>
  <p>
    The optional 5 second recording is kept in your browser’s memory so that you can play it back. It is not sent
    anywhere, and it is discarded when you close or reload the page. Device details shown in the “Your microphone”
    panel, such as the device name and sample rate, are displayed to you only and are not collected.
  </p>
  <p>
    Your browser controls the permission. You can withdraw it at any time from the site settings in your browser’s
    address bar.
  </p>

  <h2>Data stored on your device</h2>
  <p>
    If you use the light or dark mode button, your choice is saved in your browser’s local storage so the site looks the
    same on your next visit. It contains no personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We may use Google Analytics to understand how many people visit and which pages are useful. It collects information
    such as the pages you view, your approximate location, and your device and browser type. It does not collect your
    audio, your video or your microphone details.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical information such as your IP
    address in order to deliver pages and protect the site from abuse.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is a general-purpose tool and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page will change with it. Questions are welcome at{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</TextPage>
